Name devices and see where they are attached

Usage:
  olr clients [command]

Available Commands:
  show        Inspect the client inventory

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for clients

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr clients [command] --help" for more information about a command.
